Z||000002||Fiero_24||08-08-2001||08:28 AM||||Mine is a little more drastic than that (800rpm-1400rpm), and cleaning the throttle body and the IAC did not help.  Mine does not rev higher, it just sounds like it is trying to cut out, or a misfire.  I even replaced the IAC.  My next part to try is the pick up coil.  I have replaced all the ignition components, but not the pick up coil.<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||1
